            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>Described is an apparatus. The apparatus may comprise a first circuitry and a second circuitry. The first circuitry may be operable to generate one or more parameters associated with a Discontinuous Reception (DRX) paging cycle of the UE, and store the one or more parameters in a memory. The second circuitry may be operable to generate a message for transmission to the UE such that the message comprises the one or more parameters associated with the DRX paging cycle of the UE.</p>
            </abstract>
